  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Slovakia Ground Water Modeling Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Vrakuna landfill in Bratislava poses significant risks to groundwater quality, threatening the &#x17D;itn&#xFD; Ostrov region, a critical source of drinking water. Past remediation efforts were initiated but later halted, leaving the contamination unresolved. A hydraulic and transport numerical model should be developed to generate 2D and 3D models to simulate groundwater flow and contaminant transport, providing vital insights to inform future remediation and environmental management strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
